## Evidence of Automated Controls

The following automated controls are active:

- `scripts/check-all.mjs L1` — runs on every commit (pre-commit hook)
- `scripts/check-all.mjs L2` — runs on every push (pre-push hook)
- Nightly CI (`06-nightly-lite.yml`) — dependency CVE refresh + integration tests
- Cosign attestation — every release artifact is signed with OIDC identity
- `scripts/check-solo-reactivation.mjs` — author-count reactivation check (nightly)

